    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862030/extras/85509f4ed8540ab9ecbf4758013bda0b.webp?t=1642867417\" /></div><br>Duloga is a reverse space shooter where you choose who lives and dies.<br><strong>Can You Survive 7 Nights?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURING...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Seven full levels. Can you SURVIVE all of them?</strong><br></li><li><strong>State-of-the-art RGB COLORS!</strong><br></li><li><strong>GUIDE a crowd to weed out criminals!</strong><br></li><li><strong>High resolution 8-BIT GRAPHICS!</strong><br></li><li><strong>Help COPS meet their quota!</strong><br></li><li><strong>CHOOSE who deserves to die.</strong><br><br><br><i>Duloga is a game about our struggle against police brutality, extrajudicial killings, red-tagging, and state terrorism in the Philippines.</i></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862030/extras/85509f4ed8540ab9ecbf4758013bda0b.webp?t=1642867417\" /></div><br>Duloga is a reverse space shooter where you choose who lives and dies.<br><strong>Can You Survive 7 Nights?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURING...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Seven full levels. Can you SURVIVE all of them?</strong><br></li><li><strong>State-of-the-art RGB COLORS!</strong><br></li><li><strong>GUIDE a crowd to weed out criminals!</strong><br></li><li><strong>High resolution 8-BIT GRAPHICS!</strong><br></li><li><strong>Help COPS meet their quota!</strong><br></li><li><strong>CHOOSE who deserves to die.</strong><br><br><br><i>Duloga is a game about our struggle against police brutality, extrajudicial killings, red-tagging, and state terrorism in the Philippines.</i></li></ul>",
